MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8b4da19336b54fa4ebf67db148f50e9c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lemon
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCData
  npcName: Lemon
  defaultConversationKey: default
  conversations:
  - key: default
    dialogueLine:
      npcText: Well well, humie. I'm sure you've heard of me. Creative folks like
        us know how to fill the world with color, don't we? I'll bet you could make
        a whole painting of a blue sky.
      choices:
      - choiceText: you want a blue painting?
        endsConversation: 0
        setsConversationKey: lemon_bluesky_1
        action: 1
        actionParam: lemon_sky_quest
        nextLine:
          npcText: 
          choices: []
          nextLineKey: 
      nextLineKey: 
  - key: lemon_bluesky_1
    dialogueLine:
      npcText: Hm, looks OK. But what good is a sky without some twinkling stars?
        Oh, I'll bet you could do that, couldn't you?
      choices:
      - choiceText: Another one?
        endsConversation: 0
        setsConversationKey: lemon_bluesky_2
        action: 1
        actionParam: lemon_sky_quest
        nextLine:
          npcText: 
          choices: []
          nextLineKey: 
      nextLineKey: 
  - key: lemon_bluesky_2
    dialogueLine:
      npcText: OK, wow, fancy humie here doing their sky thing. Not like you could
        really go for it with all kinds of special colors though, right?
      choices:
      - choiceText: Last one
        endsConversation: 0
        setsConversationKey: lemon_bluesky_3
        action: 1
        actionParam: lemon_sky_quest
        nextLine:
          npcText: 
          choices: []
          nextLineKey: 
      nextLineKey: 
  - key: lemon_bluesky_3
    dialogueLine:
      npcText: Not bad for a humie. Now, tell me, which of these do you think is
        the best sky? Don't be shy...
      choices:
      - choiceText: Hmm
        endsConversation: 0
        setsConversationKey: 
        action: 2
        actionParam: lemon_sky_quest
        nextLine:
          npcText: 
          choices: []
          nextLineKey: 
      nextLineKey: 
  - key: lemon_bluesky_4
    dialogueLine:
      npcText: OK, yeah, humie here's got taste. Now I know you don't got the Scraps
        to put this out there, which is why you came to me. I'll loan you everything
        you need and come to collect my Scraps with interest later.
      choices: []
      nextLineKey: 
  - key: lemon_bluesky_c
    dialogueLine:
      npcText: Pleasure doing business with you, humie! Be seeing you!
      choices:
      - choiceText: Thanks
        endsConversation: 1
        setsConversationKey: 
        action: 0
        actionParam: 
        nextLine:
          npcText: 
          choices: []
          nextLineKey: 
      nextLineKey: 
